  "description": "One amber body swollen until it fills the plate — it runs to the rim on the top, right and bottom and its outline crosses onto the gold at the right, on purpose — with three segment bands curving across it and a highlight up on the shoulder. Down in the free lower-left corner sits a body of the ordinary size, a pale oval with one band, there to be the ruler. Half again the body, more health and more area is a relic about being large, so the icon is mostly not-plate. No eyes, no legs, no face: it is a mass with segments and not an animal looking at you.",
